<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>“With one accord,” until the mighty gift</l><l>Of pentecostal power was outpoured;</l><l>Then forth as witnesses possessed of God,</l><l>To preach the resurrection of the Lord!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>“With one accord” within the house of God</l><l>A hallelujah song is daily raised,</l><l>As with the voice of one, from vocal hearts</l><l>Christ Jesus’ name is glorified and praised.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Pour down Thy Spirit once again, dear Lord;</l><l>Our cry goes up to Thee for “latter rain“;</l><l>Unite Thy people as the “heart of one,”</l><l>And pentecostal days shall come again!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
